    "✏️s/🧑‍💻dev/🎭️variants/🌍️gis/💡️services/📇️catalog/📣️publisher/🟦️.ts",
    "🧰️framework/🛍️products/🦑️repo/🔨️modules/🧪️test/📜️script.ts",
